    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4903" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁμαμιθάδες</span></b> , αἱ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mince-meat,</i> Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.86R.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαμίξαι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπνῖξαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλίζω, ἀμμιάξαι.</span>)
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάναν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμαξαν,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμανδαλοῖ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφανίζει,</span> Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάνδᾰλος</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφανής</span>
			, as if <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάλδανος</span> fr.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμαλδύνω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				123
			</span></i>.</div>
